Board of Directors of the SHFC. -
The Board of
Directors of the SHFC shall be composed of the following:
HUDCC Chairman as ex-officio Chairman;
SHFC President as ex-officio Vice Chairman;
Secretary of the Department of Finance or his designated
representative;
Secretary of the Department of the Interior and Local
Government, or his designated representative;
POMA Hologram « 23908

Secretary of the Department of Budget and Management, or
his designated representative;
Representative from the Bangko Sentral ng Pilipinas [BSP]
designated by the BSP Governor;
Representative from the NHMFC designated by the Board of
Directors of NHMFC; and
Four (4) representatives from the private sector, who shall be
nominated by the President of the Republic of the Philippines.
